{"version":1,"content":"<p>ViuTV今天（21日）於旺角舉行2027節目巡禮，謝安琪（Kay）在新劇《完美的偽裝》跟鄧麗欣（Stephy）合作，Kay挑戰個性反差大的醫美公司高層，劇集明年3月開拍，她開心再跟Stephy重聚：「20年前我第一次拍電影《保持愛你》，就是跟Stephy合作。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T15:41:42.122607+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:48:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T11:37:43.450035+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T15:37:43.884170+00:00","content_hash":"943d8fc45dc45403bc6e5dcee15547c25a7873a6d33526fe1b51471a74ab6268","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}